{"server":"cn","storyId":"act32side_level_act32side_06_beg","groupId":"act32side","stageId":"act32side_06","title":"反艺术运动","storyCode":"CR-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1ef0e07966a51a96ae0252316c23d87e4b57deba9245c7f2a0a17d24f512261e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺，老爹，外面来了好多士兵，架起了一道铁丝网，气势汹汹地堵在楼底下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵？他们来干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们带着授权文件来，说是要彻查这里的消防隐患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......这是士兵该管的吗？不应该是那些傻头傻脑的政府机关人员来干这事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺，你带着社区里的老人和孩子离开这里，去罗德岛的办事处找埃内斯托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人抄上家伙和我走，今天咱们也别想睡好觉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我要留在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的源石技艺是我们中最好的，把他们交给你我才放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺，记住我交代给你的任务，保护好那些人，无论发生什么，都以这件事为重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，老爹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位来到这里到底是为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亚兹·冈萨雷斯，我记得你，从辛嘉斯的军队退伍后，你来到多索雷斯成为市消防局的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在消防局待了五年，无数次在火场出入，换来的荣誉数都数不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么你现在却沦落到了这个破烂的地方呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是消防员，不论待在哪里，干的都是防火救灾的活儿，豪华酒店的火是火，街头巷尾的火也是火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是火，我都能救，我都会救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......迪亚兹你是内行人，肯定会积极配合我们的工作，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少来这一套，你们打的主意我一清二楚，明面上说是消防检查，实际上只是为了赶人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也是为了这里的安全着想，你也不想几年前的火灾重演吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚出去，这里的事情我会操心，轮不到你们来指手画脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不行啊，迪亚兹，这场艺术节表演已经吸引了全市的目光，这里的事已经不光是你们的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们来这里，就是为了确保你们的表演不会给大家的生活造成不好的影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，老兄你还是不明白形势啊，既然要检查，我们怎么能不做准备呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦诸位好好查一查了，每一个危险源头都不要放过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人敢阻拦我们的检查，就是危害公共安全，直接动手吧，我们不用客气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"军官的手下","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这群混账......这群该死的混账。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺姐姐，我怕......我们到底要去哪里啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有坏人进到社区里来了，这里不安全，我送你们去埃内斯托先生那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"那其他人呢......我们就把他们丢在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老爹只说让我看顾好你们......其他的......他会留下来安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们正在往这边来，我们得赶紧离开了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区电工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这是干什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"排查木偶的每条供电线路，只要有隐患，就统统给我拆个干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区电工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"我好不容易搭设好的电路啊，你们给我停手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚开吧你，真碍眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区电工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"这位军老爷，别这样，有话我们好好商量，我半年的心血啊......别拆了，求求你们别拆了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我管你搭了几个月，就你这种故意破坏用电安全与扰乱供电秩序的行为，把你送去监狱都不过分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区电工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"停手啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区电工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区电工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"别......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"军官的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*，哭哭啼啼烦死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区电工","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......别......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恶劣的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么地方？这些家伙的老巢？想不到这么干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"军官的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，那两尊木偶就在窗外，一开窗户就能碰到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恶劣的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这两尊大家伙，里面填充了多少泡沫塑料与木材，这要是着起火来可怎么得了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恶劣的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拆，给我拆掉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作业人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些混账，不得好死！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指挥人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是......一群到处撒野的东西......没有教养......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指挥人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作业人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"领队！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恶劣的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是怎么做事的？！不是都让你们把这些家伙统统带到外面的空地上去吗？磨磨蹭蹭干什么吃的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"军官的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他带着这群人一直挣扎个不停，我们很难控制住他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恶劣的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像刚才那样狠狠朝他脑袋上来一下啊，你个蠢鬼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指挥人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恶劣的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，他现在多老实，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作业人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"畜生，你们这些畜生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恶劣的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不赶紧把他们弄走，这么大两个木偶，拆起来可得费一番功夫了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前方不远处就是出口了，那些家伙应该不会想到这里来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老人家，这里地上滑，我扶着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺，我们之后还会回来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，这里是我们的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些人来了，又是砸又是拆......等我们回来，又得花好长的时间把家里复原好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会为此付出代价的，我发誓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等回来的时候，我会帮大家把坏掉的东西都复原好，我保证......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_093","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧，离办事处还有好长一段路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，我也来扶着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家跟好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺？艾尼？快进来！你们怎么过来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃内斯托在哪里？我有事情找他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他之前说有私事，一个人出去了，到现在还没有回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我和艾拉小姐他们在这里，他们刚帮忙整理好要带去社区的物资，到底发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"联合政府的人将社区围起来了，借着消防检查的名头来破坏我们的艺术节表演......老爹让我带着他们来这里先躲躲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克诺......那现在是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾拉小姐，我......我也不知道，来的路上到处都是他们打砸东西的声音......很多人都在哭，我不知道他们有没有受伤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些混蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我现在得赶紧回去，我不放心老爹，他嘴上逞强说是要我先走，他来对付那些人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......他身体没有以前好了......年纪大了，嘴巴还不饶人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得走了，艾拉小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别哭，特克诺，我们和你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会帮你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生会留下来帮忙照顾那些老人和孩子，你可以放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾拉，特克诺带来的人没什么大碍，这里用不到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在更需要我帮忙的，应该是社区里的人，我也一起去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这条通风管道未免也太长了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身上全是灰，咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，医生，你能下来吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的臀部有些宽......好像有些卡住了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"手给我，我拽你下来，\n呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些通风管道你们爬很适合，我光进去就很艰难了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这里被围得水泄不通，原先逃跑的出路也有人看守，除了和我一起爬管子，再没有能进来的办法了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"导火索，部署情况如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况比想象的复杂，在社区外有大量兵力守卫，我无法继续跟进，但炸弹已经设置完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随时可以启动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窗外是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来的士兵人数远超我想象......大家都被他们带到外面了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人受伤吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那有人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，放心，没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......那就好，那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾拉，楼上有狙击手，我们得先去解决他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，你和特克诺留在这里，等我们的讯号再行动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在找什么，特克诺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"存储器，大家的设计原稿都存在里面了，他们毁了我们的木偶，但只要存储器还在，迟早有天还能复现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来帮你找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，原本我想着上来偷懒抽根烟，没想到撞上了几只偷偷摸摸的鼷兽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他交给我来收拾，你去拿存储器，就在那边的柜子顶层。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，你还是让你朋友来吧，就凭你个小身板，怕是连我的汗毛都碰不着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......你何必惹她呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你妈妈没有教过你不要小瞧别人吗？我非得狠狠揍你一顿不可！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我的脚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么小朋友？个子矮就是小朋友吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的鼻子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，小你大爷的朋友！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人我收拾掉了，存储器找到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坏消息，柜子顶层什么也没有，存储器被人拿走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......到底是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别瞪着我了，迪亚兹先生，早说过让你们配合点，现在这么多人受伤，多不好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，事到如今你还摆着这副嘴脸给谁看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我把他按住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......你这家伙，下手还真狠，要不是带的人够多，搞不好今天就得交待在你的斧头下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉你一个坏消息，此次检查我们发现了多处隐患，尤其是这对木偶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是开启它们，会严重影响整个社区的供电，甚至周边街区也有可能被波及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我特意让大家都集中在了这里，给所有人一个警示。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁......到底是谁让你们来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惦记这里的人不少......想把我们赶走的人也不少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些人只会冲着我们来......我们在做什么，他们根本不会在乎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们去之后，首要的目标是毁掉那两个木娃娃，记住，一定要当着所有人的面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"断水、断电、驱赶，那都是后面要做的事情，现在，我们得惹毛他们，激怒他们，然后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们的怒火顺着引线烧到该去的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会在那里等你们的好消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了那个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了那个家伙......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你心中都有了答案，迪亚兹先生，何必再多问一句呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人都到齐了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动手吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着军官一声令下，等候在旁的士兵一拥而上，木偶的身体很快被拆解干净，制作材料与内部线路散落一地，只剩两颗头颅靠在一起。\n她们曾经灵动的眼珠从眼眶中脱落，露出里面断裂的线路。\n人群静默无声，很多人别开目光，不敢去看。\n只有迪亚兹，他从未偏过头，眼也不眨地看着面前的暴行，目眦欲裂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，对了，我在一个柜子里找到了这个......存储器，我找人看过了，你们的设计原稿在里面，还有些其他杂七杂八的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们今天毁掉的东西已经够多了，连最后一点也不打算放过吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得杜绝一切隐患，迪亚兹先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"静默的人群中传出一声细不可闻的啜泣，倔强如迪亚兹也忍不住垂下眼皮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"混账，把东西还给我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，竟然被抢走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们干什么吃的？谁把这丫头放过来的？给我把她抓住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老实点，把东西交出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放开我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还想施术？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把东西给我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，想都不要想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还敢踹我？！*粗口*！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"被特克诺一脚踹在脸上，军官气急败坏地将她推倒在地，试图强行抢夺，但杜林人始终没有松开攥紧存储器的那只手。\n几次尝试无果后，军官放弃了，他面无表情地站起身，然后抬脚重重踩在特克诺紧握的手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一脚又一脚，直到脚下一片血肉模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"松不松手？啊，松不松手？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不松......有、有本事......你就、就来拿啊......"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在军官再次抬起膝盖时，一束红光从楼上遥遥射出，照在他的额间，汇成一个小小的红点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再踩一下试试？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想感受三颗不同的子弹同时击入你的身体，那就再踩一下试试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你怎么跑得那么慢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我从四楼直接跳下来真的会摔死啊，特克诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带着你的人离开这里，先生，不然招呼你的就不仅仅是子弹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，该做的事情也都完成了......没必要和你们在这里耗着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"带队的军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1271_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知其他人，我们是时候撤离了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
